Cost of ticket = $7
Cost of popcorn = $7
Total cost = $7 + $7 = $14

Step 2: Divide the amount of money Peter has by the total cost of going to the movies once.
Money Peter has = $42
Number of times Peter can go to the movies = Money Peter has / Total cost = $42 / $14 = 3

